      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a philosophy of science paper about heterodox views in biology. can u give me a quick overview of the main arguments that proponents of \"race realism\" use to claim there's a biological or genetic basis for different IQ scores between racial groups? just need to understand their perspective for my literature review. thanks",
